-- cyclohexane as one list of motions. The chair's rotations are unhindered at every temperature; the
-- chair flip crosses the rate this experiment resolves at about 210 K, which is where the measurement
-- puts the coalescence -- the single peak broadens from about -60 C and is fully resolved below -89 C.
cyh-motions : List TempMotion
cyh-motions = cons (cyh-c3 , rate-flat 12 , true) (cons (cyh-c2 , rate-flat 12 , true) (cons (cyh-flip , rate-step 21 5 0 , true) nil))
